 </span><span begin="00:51.976" end="00:52.264">Puppy </span><span begin="00:52.264" end="00:52.552">love</span><span begin="00:52.552" end="00:52.840">" </span><span begin="00:52.840" end="00:53.128">must </span><span begin="00:53.128" end="00:53.416">have </span><span begin="00:53.416" end="00:53.704">it's </span><span begin="00:53.704" end="00:53.992">day</span><span begin="00:53.992" end="00:54.280"> </span><span begin="00:54.280" end="00:54.568">-</span><span begin="00:54.568" end="00:54.856">ay</span><span begin="00:54.856" end="00:55.144">-</span><span begin="00:55.144" end="00:55.432">ay</span><span begin="00:55.432" end="00:55.720">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.720" end="00:59.200"><span begin="00:55.720" end="00:56.080">Don'tcha </span><span begin="00:56.080" end="00:56.470">know </span><span begin="00:56.470" end="00:56.650">it's </span><span begin="00:56.650" end="00:57.130">much </span><span begin="00:57.130" end="00:57.640">more </span><span begin="00:57.640" end="00:58.120">fun </span><span begin="00:58.120" end="00:58.420">to </span><span begin="00:58.420" end="00:58.930">love</span><span begin="00:58.930" end="00:59.200">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.200" end="01:03.550"><span begin="00:59.200" end="00:59.441">While </span><span begin="00:59.441" end="00:59.682">the </span><span begin="00:59.682" end="00:59.923">heart </span><span begin="00:59.923" end="01:00.164">is </span><span begin="01:00.164" end="01:00.405">young </span><span begin="01:00.405" end="01:00.646">and </span><span begin="01:00.646" end="01:00.887">gay</span><span begin="01:00.887" end="01:01.128">-</span><span begin="01:01.128" end="01:01.369">ay</span><span begin="01:01.369" end="01:01.610">-</span><span begin="01:01.610" end="01:01.851">ay</span><span begin="01:01.851" end="01:02.092">-</span><span begin="01:02.092" end="01:02.333">ay</span><span begin="01:02.333" end="01:02.574">-</span><span begin="01:02.574" end="01:02.815">ay</span><span begin="01:02